    <panel_attributes>title=SD10 Generate and validate a study plan
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=StudyPlanGenerator~g
obj=CourseService~c
obj=ProgressTracker~t
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=ResponseParser~p
obj=StudyPlanRepository~r

u-&gt;f : createStudyPlan(courseId, examDate, hoursPerDay)
f-&gt;g : generate(courseId, examDate, hoursPerDay)
g:checkInput checks real dates and whole hours from 1 to 24
g-&gt;c : getCourse(courseId)
c.&gt;g : saved Course
g:If the course has no chunks, return an error before a model call
g-&gt;t : getRankedStats(courseId, minResults)
t.&gt;g : graded-only topic context
g:Without enough evidence require a diagnostic quiz first
combinedFragment=loop~proposal g p; p:[At most three proposals]
g-&gt;l : generate(studyPlanPrompt)
l.&gt;g : proposed tasks or failure
g-&gt;p : parseStudyTasks(text)
p.&gt;g : dated tasks
g:validatePlan(plan, today), then check diagnostic-first work
--
g:Only a validated proposal may be saved
g-&gt;r : savePlan(valid plan)
r.&gt;g : saved or error
g.&gt;f : actual saved schedule or explicit error
f.&gt;u : plan or error</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
</diagram>